---
import GCHHudLabel from "./GCHHudLabel.astro";
const items = [
  ["Do we have to buy everything at once?","No. GCH can start with one priority and add connected capabilities as the organization grows."],
  ["Can GCH work with our existing website or hosting?","Yes. The solution path can begin with an audit, redesign, migration, SEO work, or a focused product without forcing a full rebuild."],
  ["Is this only for churches?","No. GCH is designed for ministries, nonprofits, coaches, creators, Christian businesses, and other mission-driven organizations."],
  ["How do hosting and marketing work together?","They remain separate capabilities, but the experience is coordinated so the site, domain, infrastructure, search visibility, and ongoing support do not feel fragmented."],
  ["Will we understand what is being built?","That is a core design requirement. Blueprint views, implementation notes, and clear service boundaries are meant to make the system understandable to non-technical teams."],
];
---
<section class="gch-faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="gch-faq-title">
  <div class="gch-faq__intro"><GCHHudLabel index="31" label="FAQ / objection handling" /><h2 id="gch-faq-title">Questions that usually come before the decision.</h2><p>Answer the practical concerns without forcing visitors to schedule a call first.</p></div>
  <div class="gch-faq__list">
    {items.map(([q,a],i)=><details open={i===0}><summary><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}
  </div>
  <a class="gch-faq__cta" href="/start">Still need help? Talk to GCH →</a>
</section>
<style>
.gch-faq{padding-block:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem)}.gch-faq__intro h2{max-width:13ch;margin:.8rem 0 1rem;font:800 clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4rem)/.98 "JetBrains Mono",monospace;letter-spacing:-.05em;text-transform:uppercase}.gch-faq__intro p,.gch-faq details p{color:var(--gch-text-secondary);font:400 1rem/1.6 "Outfit",sans-serif}.gch-faq__list{border-top:1px solid var(--gch-border-light)}.gch-faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--gch-border-light);padding:0}.gch-faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.15rem 0;font:700 .95rem/1.3 "Outfit",sans-serif}.gch-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.gch-faq summary span{color:var(--gch-gold-text);font:700 .62rem/1.4 "JetBrains Mono",monospace}.gch-faq details p{margin:0 0 1.2rem 2.4rem}.gch-faq__cta{grid-column:2;color:var(--gch-text-primary);font:700 .9rem/1 "Outfit",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;width:max-content}.gch-faq__cta:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gch-blue);outline-offset:4px}.gch-faq summary:focus-visible{border-radius:.3rem}@media(max-width:820px){.gch-faq{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gch-faq__cta{grid-column:1}}
</style>